    "description": "Cross\nCentury Series Pen and Pencil Set\nSterling Silver .925, Vintage Made in USA\nThis vintage Cross Century writing set features a matching ballpoint pen and mechanical pencil crafted from solid sterling silver. Known for their iconic slim profile and exceptional balance, these American-made instruments represent the height of mid-century professional elegance. The set features the classic engine-turned pinstripe pattern that has defined the Cross brand for decades.\nHallmarked sterling silver construction with vertical pinstripe engraving\nIncludes twist-action ballpoint pen and matching mechanical pencil\nMade in the USA with \"Sterling Silver\" markings readable on the cap barrels\nHoused in original tan velvet-lined hardshell presentation case with documentation\nCondition:\nExcellent vintage condition. The sterling silver bodies show a bright finish with very light surface patina consistent with age and gentle handling. Both the pen and pencil mechanisms are intact with no visible damage. The original case is structurally sound with light exterior shelf wear. Includes original guarantee card and manufacturer's care instructions.\nPlease Read:\nAll items are donated and may exhibit signs of wear, including surface dirt, discoloration, scratches, and scuffs. Glassware and dishes may display color fading, crazing, or chips. Clothing items may have loose threads or fabric pilling. The full functionality of electrical items is not guaranteed. Purses may show wear on the bottom edges, corners, and handles. Jewelry metal content and stones have not been tested unless explicitly stated, and stones have not been individually inspected. Items sold in lots have not been counted or sorted and may contain small or damaged pieces. Returns are not accepted for these items.\nPlease carefully review photos and descriptions prior to bidding. If you have any questions or uncertainties, please contact us by opening a customer service ticket.",
